  {
   "id": "s1",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 2.1,
   "end": 7.8,
   "text": "好，人都到齐了，我们开始吧。今天主要对一下 0.22 版的发布计划。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 8.4,
   "end": 15.2,
   "text": "先说时间，原定下周三发，现在桌面端还有两个问题没收尾。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 16.0,
   "end": 22.6,
   "text": "录音和转写这边已经在 Mac 上跑通了，Windows 的系统声音还没接上。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 23.1,
   "end": 29.4,
   "text": "我建议先发 Mac 和 Linux，Windows 放到下一个小版本。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 30.2,
   "end": 36.9,
   "text": "可以，这样不卡整体进度。那安装包里要不要带上转写模型？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 37.5,
   "end": 45.0,
   "text": "不带。模型一百六十兆，第一次用的时候再下载，走系统代理，国内也能下。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 46.1,
   "end": 52.3,
   "text": "行。那文档和更新说明谁来写？",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "me",
   "start": 53.0,
   "end": 58.8,
   "text": "我来写，周二之前给大家看。",
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "meeting": "m1",
   "track": "them",
   "start": 59.6,
   "end": 66.4,
   "text": "好，那就定下周三发 Mac 和 Linux，Windows 下周再说。",
   "edited": false
  }
 ]
